ware; those are limitations, but no missing runtime fact is decisive because the stated premises directly specify the relevant permission outcomes.","facts":[{"id":"entry-notes-action","kind":"entry","statement":"The notes action accepts POST and declares PaperlessNotePermissions as its permission class.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1,"endLine":8}]},{"id":"binding-current-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the authenticated request principal as currentUser.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":8,"endLine":9}]},{"id":"binding-target-document","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler resolves the target document from pk, selecting its owner identity and notes.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":11,"endLine":15}]},{"id":"control-global-post-permission","kind":"control","statement":"The action-level PaperlessNotePermissions gate is the visible global permission control; the supplied premise states that its required global POST permissions are held.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1,"endLine":5}]},{"id":"condition-object-view","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler forbids access to notes when the current user lacks an owner-aware view_document permission on the target document; the supplied premise states that the caller has this object view grant.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":17,"endLine":22}]},{"id":"control-owner-aware-change","kind":"control","statement":"In the POST branch, the handler checks owner-aware change_document permission on the target document and returns HTTP 403 when the check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":37,"endLine":46}]},{"id":"condition-change-denied","kind":"condition","statement":"Under the supplied premise, the caller is not the document owner and lacks the target document's object change_document grant, so the owner-aware change check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":39,"endLine":46}]},{"id":"effect-note-create","kind":"effect","statement":"Note.objects.create would create the note for the target document, with the submitted note content and current user, but execution cannot reach it after the failed change check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":48,"endLine":52}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2609,"output":1019,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":51014.51019999999,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:28:33.559Z"}}
